  },
  {
    q: 'What is EU size 42 in UK shoe sizing?',
    a: 'A European EU size 42 corresponds directly to British UK size 8.0 for men. It fits an anatomical footbed of 27.0 centimeters (10.6 inches), corresponding to an American US Men\'s 9.0.'
  },
