    a: 'A European EU 44 translates to a British UK 9.5 to UK 10 (approx. 28.5 to 29.0 cm foot length / US Men 10.5–11.0). A European EU 45 corresponds to a British UK 10 to 10.5 (approx. 29.0 to 29.5 cm foot length / US Men 11.0–11.5).'
